## Methods Summary

**Model:** Gradient-boosted trees (XGBoost) with 626 features across patient clinical characteristics, treatment context, and therapist/organizational factors

**Validation:** Temporal split (80% training: Jan 2021-May 2023; 20% validation: Jun-Dec 2023)

**Inference:** Doubly robust estimation with cross-fitting to estimate therapy-specific treatment effects

**Outcome:** Improvement from moderate/high to lower suicide risk by first reassessment (mean 5.9 days)

